Package: oofalse
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign POSIX false utility and deterministic exit code analyzer in pure openOODA.
 Instant zero-byte binary returning exit status 1 without runtime overhead.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 exit code diagnostics, pipeline simulation, and a streaming Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
